{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>吃完重口味食物，有口氣怕影響形象？不如試下由日本女星介紹的口臭退散糖果！來自韓國的 Xylitol Stone成為近年極具話題性的護齒零食！這款糖果主打採用 100% 天然木糖醇製成，外觀如同彩色礦石，賣相非常精緻。最大亮點在於不含任何蔗糖且低熱量，木糖醇成分能有效抑制口腔內造成齲齒的細菌滋生、中和酸性物質，同時促進唾液分泌，從源頭打擊口腔異味、保持持久清新好氣息！非常適合在餐後，或是長時間配戴口罩時候食用！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178680981292751752_3214451876a808dd572250.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178680981520493880_668980956a808dd7a2e5c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178680981669968280_7290018756a808dd922ee4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178680981909462269_2585347976a808ddb8d6de.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/17868098207381869_2134575516a808ddd09425.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-15T16:20:41.329883+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}